# Transient baseline copy written by check-goal-router.mjs (PID-suffixed). The
# guard removes stale ones itself, but an interrupted run leaves one behind and
# it surfaces as untracked noise mid-run.
hooks/scripts/.baseline-prompt-check-*.mjs
